    stage3_coordinator_route_cold_init_unreachable_under_env_i_2026-09-14, 1, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/stage3_coordinator_route_cold_init_unreachable_under_env_i_2026-09-14.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    stage3_coordinator_route_cold_init_unreachable_under_env_i_2026-09-14, 7, "2026-11-09 status fix-implemented-verification-pending: aaf49796f5b (on release): resume-stage3-from-admitted.sh forwards SIMPLE_SCV_INVENTORY_COLD_INIT=1 via env -i. Second finding (direct fallback never fires) NOT addressed; split if still wanted."

